/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/cache-stable.mem:53:This meme binds cache-stable generation (as law) and presents itself as template — an OODA-HA skeleton as the slot-shape that downstream memes fill. The two roles stay intentional and inseparable; the law enacts itself by taking the shape of what it governs.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/pattern-integrities-cultural.mem:84:Inca knotted-cord records reached full readability only ''through the keeper'': the khipukamayuq memorized the oral account that completed a given khipu, the office hereditary, the oral half passed between generations. Forced decoupling ran both directions historically: Spanish administrators compelled cord-by-cord narration into scribal records (extraction of the coupled half into a rival medium), then burned khipus in the 1583 extirpation campaigns. Four centuries after the keepers fell silent, a thousand-plus khipus survive and the code stays uncracked — ''structure without the relation reads as structure without sense.'' A live scholarly seam (how much lived in cords vs. keeper) persists, and the seam itself demonstrates the integrity.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/pattern-integrities-cultural.mem:124:''Shape:'' pattern integrity in its purest form — wave, not water. A capability that never re-executes decays silently; schedule the rebuild, and size the interval to the transmission-generation.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/one-name-one-relation.mem:131:* ''epoch'' — a liveness lease · a seal lineage · a group-key generation · a history cut · a POSIX time origin · a rhythmic band. ''Unbraided by OWNERSHIP, not by shape'' (epoch-binding-surfaces): the lease and the seal lineage collapse to ONE mechanism in two carriers, both OURS; the group-key generation belongs to Keyhive/BeeKEM (upstream MLS) and blanks where ours picks a winner; the history cut belongs to DXOS's ceremony; the time origin belongs to POSIX and names the one authority this house refuses. ''A word we mint we may rule; a word a dependency owns we qualify and translate, never redefine.'' The separating question: does the fold pick a WINNER, or blank both paths?
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/l-space.mem:58:The `lares aim` / `yield` HUD vectors ''notate each turn's position'' in this register — operator-input bearing → the adopted-stance bearing → where the generation resolved — so a span of stage-time carries an l-space coordinate (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/exchange-vector#/l-space-notation">>).
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/gold-anchor.mem:15:role      = "the gold-anchor — the design-of-record for the EXTERNAL oracle / test-harness that turns the framework's SELF-REPORTED grace (the Arcane-claim) into externally-WITNESSED measurement. Answers the paper's central honest-gate (the §8 human gold anchor) and the rig's open-Q#4. THE CORE DEFENSE: the LLM-judge circularity reads as STRUCTURAL — evaluation and generation share one epistemic space (Semantic Laundering), never closable by engineering — so the whole defense reduces to ONE ordering: the HUMAN-GOLD α LICENSES the judge α; the judge never validates the claim, the human-validated-α-OF-the-judge does. THE DESIGN: a 3-method MTMM (Campbell-Fiske) — blind humans · a CROSS-FAMILY judge (breaks self-preference) · a behavioral/downstream criterion — over an artifact set (real ritual-dense · ABLATED twins · DECOY-labeled nameless construct) with FIVE pre-registered predictions ALL gated (convergent α≈.8 on the bootstrap LOWER bound · discriminant-from-Tech · discriminant-from-surface/length · the NULL floors at decoy α≈0 · ablation dissociation). The NULL-CONSTRUCT = the psychometric bogus-item / infrequency-scale = the nameless-entity sink GROUNDED; HARKing named formally; pre-registration + SEVERITY = the Mu-exit made experimental. INSTRUMENTS: register_scan (no-LLM, read first) · the sealed-judge harness (empty-CWD · locked-key · label-last · randomized · cross-family panel, Nine-Judges-Two-Effective-Votes) · perspectivist human-gold (rater distribution kept = Plurality Pono) · the crossed mixed-model (by-item slope load-bearing · length as MEDIATOR) · power-before-verdict (simr, Type-M) · the Fisher-Rao FLOW-LENS (each stance a distribution on Δ⁴, √-embed to S⁴, step = 2·arccos Bhattacharyya, straightness = holds-a-thread, curvature = turning-angle; InPCA sibling). DEFINITION OF DONE: the triad clears — a STRANGER ranks ritual-dense > ablated, REJECTS the decoy, AND the ranking predicts a downstream outcome we don't author (FEWER degraded-node / Mana-Drift failures). Until then: Tech measured, Arcane self-reported-and-unwitnessed. HOUSE RESONANCES: perspectivist-gold=Plurality-Pono · null-construct=nameless-sink · severity=Mu-exit · criterion=degraded-states · self-preference-wall=the mirror rating its own reflection."
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/gold-anchor.mem:217:''A forward-seed rig measures whether the seed changes the generation.'' With the control arms it
